new_head "Summoner Guild To Re-open!"
new_text "Right.  I posted my message a year and a half ago, a new wiz, didn'tknow a semi-colon from a comma.Things are happening. First I coded an area, then I coded aquest.  Next challenge, I pondered...And this is it now.  I'm re-structuring whatever I can. Summonerscan come back. They can come back and kick ass.  They cancome back, be cool, keep the memories of Matt alive andcreate some new legends along the way.Thank to Tats for the inspiration, and thanks to Manglafor listening to my whining.Redsexy"
